{"id":"46e9f1b57ca011bf","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix.md","title":"∀∃等式句的Dialectica矩阵","display":"lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix — ∀∃等式句的Dialectica矩阵","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix","aliases":["72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix"],"display":"lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix — ∀∃等式句的Dialectica矩阵","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman","source_location":"V §3.2 Theorem3.2.2 print353–354/PDF365–366 and Proof3.2.3 print354/PDF366; equation-matrix instance, using the recorded atomic-double-negation N convention","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source special-case correspondence checked","proof_status":"all quantifier and negation clauses expanded; quadruple negation distinguished from double negation","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix — ∀∃等式句的Dialectica矩阵"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman"},{"key":"source_location","html":"V §3.2 Theorem3.2.2 print353–354/PDF365–366 and Proof3.2.3 print354/PDF366; equation-matrix instance, using the recorded atomic-double-negation N convention"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source special-case correspondence checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"all quantifier and negation clauses expanded; quadruple negation distinguished from double negation"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{ar},\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0},T_0\">\\(\\mathcal T_{ar},\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0},T_0\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,c,D,N\">\\(w,c,D,N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in V_{\\mathsf0}\">\\(n,m\\in V_{\\mathsf0}\\)</span> 互异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{ar}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{ar}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\{n,m\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\{n,m\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式引入局部公式缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,A\">\\(P,A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(f)\">\\(n,m\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(f)\\)</span>。翻译变量先改名，使其见证与挑战分别可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,n\">\\(f,n\\)</span> 实例化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 表示公式树的α等价。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\leftrightarrow D:=(C\\to D)\\land(D\\to C)\">\\(C\\leftrightarrow D:=(C\\to D)\\land(D\\to C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C:=C\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg C:=C\\to\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P:=s=_0t,\\qquad A:=\\forall n^{\\mathsf0}\\exists m^{\\mathsf0}P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P:=s=_0t,\\qquad A:=\\forall n^{\\mathsf0}\\exists m^{\\mathsf0}P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nw(A)&amp;=\\langle\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\qquad c(A)=\\langle\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\\\\nw(A^N)&amp;=\\langle\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\qquad c(A^N)=\\langle\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\\\\nA_D(f;n)&amp;\\equiv_\\alpha P[f n/m],\\\\\n(A^N)_D(f;n)&amp;\\equiv_\\alpha\\neg\\neg\\neg\\neg(P[f n/m]),\\\\\nT_0&amp;\\vdash (A^N)_D(f;n)\\leftrightarrow P[f n/m].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nw(A)&amp;=\\langle\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\qquad c(A)=\\langle\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\\\\nw(A^N)&amp;=\\langle\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\qquad c(A^N)=\\langle\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\\\\nA_D(f;n)&amp;\\equiv_\\alpha P[f n/m],\\\\\n(A^N)_D(f;n)&amp;\\equiv_\\alpha\\neg\\neg\\neg\\neg(P[f n/m]),\\\\\nT_0&amp;\\vdash (A^N)_D(f;n)\\leftrightarrow P[f n/m].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原子P的两个类型表为空；存在量词引入type0见证m；外层全称量词将其变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\">\\(\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\)</span> 见证，挑战为n。现有N约定给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^N=\\neg\\neg P\">\\(P^N=\\neg\\neg P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^N=\\forall n\\neg\\forall m\\neg(P^N)\">\\(A^N=\\forall n\\neg\\forall m\\neg(P^N)\\)</span>。内层全称否定的挑战被外层否定转为见证m，所以最后矩阵是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg(P^N[f n/m])\">\\(\\neg\\neg(P^N[f n/m])\\)</span>，即四重否定。末式是T0无量词经典重言式的实例。不能把此原子的字面矩阵等式推广到含析取的任意无量词矩阵：析取会另引入tag见证。原书更广的有界矩阵结果需先给特征函数编码；本条刻意保留准确的等式矩阵子类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 的 $\\mathcal T_{ar},\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0},T_0$ 和 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]] 的 $w,c,D,N$。$n,m\\in V_{\\mathsf0}$ 互异；$s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{ar}$，$\\operatorname{FV}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\{n,m\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 的 $\\mathcal T_{ar},\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0},T_0$ 和 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]] 的 $w,c,D,N$。$n,m\\in V_{\\mathsf0}$ 互异；$s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{ar}$，$\\operatorname{FV}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\{n,m\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{ar},\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0},T_0","display":false},{"tex":"w,c,D,N","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in V_{\\mathsf0}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{ar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\{n,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P,A","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0}","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C\\leftrightarrow D:=(C\\to D)\\land(D\\to C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C:=C\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"P:=s=_0t,\\qquad A:=\\forall n^{\\mathsf0}\\exists m^{\\mathsf0}P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nw(A)&=\\langle\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\qquad c(A)=\\langle\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\\\\nw(A^N)&=\\langle\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\qquad c(A^N)=\\langle\\mathsf0\\rangle,\\\\\nA_D(f;n)&\\equiv_\\alpha P[f n/m],\\\\\n(A^N)_D(f;n)&\\equiv_\\alpha\\neg\\neg\\neg\\neg(P[f n/m]),\\\\\nT_0&\\vdash (A^N)_D(f;n)\\leftrightarrow P[f n/m].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf0\\to\\mathsf0","display":false},{"tex":"P^N=\\neg\\neg P","display":false},{"tex":"A^N=\\forall n\\neg\\forall m\\neg(P^N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg(P^N[f n/m])","display":false}],"bytes":2611,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix|lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix — ∀∃等式句的Dialectica矩阵]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix — ∀∃等式句的Dialectica矩阵](72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-dialectica-pi02-equation-matrix]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-dialectica-pi02-e